    "dashboard_notification_verify_ancs_body" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Keep PTSpeed connected to XP400 and close the Peugeot app.\n2. Lock the iPhone.\n3. Use another phone to place a real call and send a real SMS.\n4. Test a third-party app notification separately.\n\nThis is the valid instrument test. The iPhone local test only verifies iOS notification delivery."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Keep PTSpeed connected to XP400 and close the Peugeot app.\n2. Lock the iPhone.\n3. Use another phone to place a real call and send a real SMS.\n4. Test a third-party app notification separately.\n\nThis is the valid instrument test. The iPhone local test only verifies iOS notification delivery."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Mantenga PTSpeed ​​conectado al XP400 y cierre la aplicación Peugeot.\n2. Bloquea el iPhone.\n3. Utilice otro teléfono para realizar una llamada real y enviar un SMS real.\n4. Pruebe la notificación de una aplicación de terceros por separado.\n\nEsta es la prueba instrumental válida. La prueba local de iPhone solo verifica la entrega de notificaciones de iOS."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Keep PTSpeed connected to XP400 and close the Peugeot app.\n2. Lock the iPhone.\n3. Use another phone to place a real call and send a real SMS.\n4. Test a third-party app notification separately.\n\nThis is the valid instrument test. The iPhone local test only verifies iOS notification delivery."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Keep PTSpeed connected to XP400 and close the Peugeot app.\n2. Lock the iPhone.\n3. Use another phone to place a real call and send a real SMS.\n4. Test a third-party app notification separately.\n\nThis is the valid instrument test. The iPhone local test only verifies iOS notification delivery."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. PTSpeed'i XP400'e bağlı tutun ve Peugeot uygulamasını kapatın.\n2. iPhone'u kilitleyin.\n3. Başka bir telefondan gerçek bir arama yapın ve gerçek bir SMS gönderin.\n4. Üçüncü taraf uygulama bildirimini ayrıca test edin.\n\nBu, gösterge için geçerli testtir. iPhone yerel testi yalnızca iOS bildirim teslimini doğrular."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 保持 PTSpeed 与 XP400 连接，并退出 Peugeot 官方 App。\n2. 锁定 iPhone。\n3. 使用另一台手机拨打真实电话并发送真实短信。\n4. 另行测试第三方 App 通知。\n\n这才是有效的仪表测试；iPhone 本地测试只能验证 iOS 通知投递。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 保持 PTSpeed 與 XP400 連線，並退出 Peugeot 官方 App。\n2. 鎖定 iPhone。\n3. 使用另一支手機撥打真實電話並傳送真實訊息。\n4. 另外測試第三方 App 通知。\n\n這才是有效的儀表測試；iPhone 本機測試只能驗證 iOS 通知傳送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
